WEBVTT

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:47.560
Getting discharged?

00:01:48.680 --> 00:01:49.160
Drop the

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:50.120
Fake concern.

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:51.800
I owe you for yesterday,

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.039
And I always pay my debts.

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:54.800
How about you owe me

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:56.120
An even bigger one?

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:57.720
What's your play here?

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:00.560
Take my spot at the winter camp.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:02.760
You're handing it over to me?

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:06.280
If you get Cao Ping

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.720
And Xing Wu to settle their beef.

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:12.000
Your brother already did a two-year stretch.

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:14.720
You don't want him back in a cell,

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:15.760
Right?

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:18.200
Why would I

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:19.200
Do you the favor?

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:21.560
I've lost family.

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:26.360
It ruins you.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:29.440
I'm going all out to protect mine,

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:31.880
And I know

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:34.640
You would

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:36.760
Do the same.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:54.760
Sweetie,

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:56.880
Get me some water.

00:02:59.160 --> 00:02:59.800
Sweetie?

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:01.600
Wu!

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:06.160
Are you alright?

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:08.680
You seem miles away.

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:12.320
Grandma...

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:14.880
Just some

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:17.000
Old drama.

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:19.560
It's time to put it to bed.

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:22.560
You're a sweet boy,

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:25.400
And I trust your judgment.

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:27.120
I won't interfere.

00:03:28.079 --> 00:03:29.040
But promise me

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:30.280
You'll protect yourself.

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:32.800
Don't get hurt again

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:33.560
Like last time.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:35.200
Your mom,

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:36.320
Myself,

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:39.160
And now Qing Ye...

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.800
We'd all be devastated.

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:45.600
There's always a smart way.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.800
Just look out for yourself.

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:51.840
I will, Grandma.

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:53.520
Trust me.

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:22.400
Hello, Officer Xu.

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:17.000
[Hello?]

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:22.800
[Ping]

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:24.360
[is gonna jump Xing Wu.]

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:25.720
[We're heading there now.]

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:27.120
[I called the police,]

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:28.520
[they're on their way.]

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:01.920
Where's Cao Ping?

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:03.680
He doesn't

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:05.400
Do grunt work for a local scrub.

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:06.720
Wreck him!

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.440
Oh, so we got a

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:24.320
Martial artist here?

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:25.280
Break his legs!

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:25.880
Hold on!

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:35.400
This beef is mine.

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:37.400
Stay out of it.

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:40.840
Cao Ping,

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:43.800
We shouldn't settle our score

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:46.040
Like this.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:48.320
I'm not settling anything.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.960
I just wanna drag you

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:53.120
Into the same hell I've been in.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:57.040
I was in that hell

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.760
Two years ago.

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:01.680
I should've

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:03.760
Thrown that game.

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:05.160
You think that's even close?

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:07.880
Two years in a cell,

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:10.040
While my sister got bullied...

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:11.880
You can never make up for that!

00:08:13.400 --> 00:08:14.040
I don't know what cr*p

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:14.880
He told you,

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:16.640
But Cao Fan's situation

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:17.760
Has zero to do

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:18.840
With Qing Ye or me!

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:19.360
Bro,

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:20.520
Why the speech?

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:21.200
Just drop him!

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:22.360
Did I ask for your opinion?

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:23.040
Get lost!

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:25.240
OK, my bad.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:26.120
Carry on.

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:33.200
Cao Ping,

00:08:34.679 --> 00:08:35.440
I'm not

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:37.360
Planning to walk away.

00:08:38.919 --> 00:08:39.960
Let's settle this beef

00:08:40.679 --> 00:08:42.159
Right now.

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:44.680
Just keep your hands

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:46.880
Off Qing Ye.

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:50.920
You think you're calling the shots?

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:30.080
Once I wreck you,

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:31.960
I'm gonna

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:33.760
Have some fun with your girl.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:56.800
Dude,

00:09:57.600 --> 00:09:58.520
Just gut him.

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:18.000
That's his ride!

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:19.320
Inside! Pull!

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:22.520
Xing Wu!

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:25.200
- Xing Wu! - Bro!

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:25.960
Oh god...

00:10:29.880 --> 00:10:31.200
On your knees!

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:32.280
You shouldn't be here.

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:34.600
Please, just stop!

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:35.840
Run!

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:39.280
I'm begging you, stop!

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:39.880
Get back!

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:41.520
Aww, how sweet,

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:43.360
The whole gang is here.

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:46.520
Bro,

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:48.000
Finish him.

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:56.440
No!

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:57.360
Wu, no!

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:01.240
- Wu... - God!

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:01.760
Qing Ye!

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:02.960
Run...

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:07.320
Ping!

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:14.960
Please...

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:16.680
Put the knife down!

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:19.360
He did nothing to you!

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:20.400
Your prison time

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:21.560
Is your own fault!

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:22.520
Cao Ping!

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:24.320
If you hadn't sliced him back then,

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:25.640
He'd be flying jets for the Air Force!

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:27.560
You ruined his life, you bastard!

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:31.560
Please!

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:33.000
Just stop,

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:34.400
Please!

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:35.720
I'm begging you!

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:37.280
Qing Ye had nothing

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:37.880
To do

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:39.400
With me passing out!

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:41.040
Xing Wu didn't do anything!

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:41.840
Move up!

00:11:41.960 --> 00:11:43.800
Why can't you let go of the past?

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:45.680
Don't ruin your life again!

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:46.520
Please...

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:49.240
Please! Put it down!

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:09.880
Ping...

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:12.040
Xing Wu!

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:13.040
My god...

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:17.280
I'm good...

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:31.240
Wu!

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:32.240
Wu...

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:45.360
Round'em up!

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:49.240
Ping...

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:50.280
Dude...

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:52.760
Wu...

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:53.680
Hey!

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:54.640
Wu, no!

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:56.080
Please!

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:56.880
Hey,

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.360
Stay with me!

00:12:58.400 --> 00:12:59.760
- Don't you die on me! - Ouch...

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:00.680
You idiot!

00:13:00.680 --> 00:13:02.200
He's in pain!

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:04.360
Where does it hurt?

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:07.040
Huh?

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:08.520
Right here...

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:10.640
What?

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:13.200
My heart...

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:19.360
Xing Wu,

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:20.800
You guys are coming

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:21.560
Too!

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:28.280
Ow, ow!

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:29.960
Easy, Doc...

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:30.680
Oh?

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:31.440
God!

00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:32.520
Serves you right!

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:33.520
Watch the hand...

00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:34.520
Grow up, kid.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:35.640
Still getting into fights?

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:37.280
Doc, easy...

00:13:37.280 --> 00:13:38.600
Got booked by the cops too?

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:40.680
Should I clap for you?

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.000
There, you're all set.

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:49.520
That's it?

00:13:50.320 --> 00:13:50.920
Qing Ye,

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:52.640
Keep him away

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:53.280
From water.

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:54.440
We don't want an infection.

00:13:54.800 --> 00:13:55.680
Keep his dressings fresh.

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:57.720
Dr. Zhuang,

00:13:57.760 --> 00:13:59.400
Should we get a second opinion?

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.040
Maybe

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:00.600
A CT

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:01.160
Or something?

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:01.960
Save your money.

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:03.520
The kid is

00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:04.640
Built like a tank.

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:05.600
He can take it.

00:14:06.040 --> 00:14:06.800
Just a scratch.

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:08.200
Nothing serious.

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:09.400
Relax.

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:10.600
Told you.

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:11.600
Dr. Zhuang

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:12.720
Is a wizard.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:14.680
Come, toots.

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:37.160
Why did you pull a stunt like that

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:39.240
Without telling me?

00:14:40.640 --> 00:14:42.240
Why did you give up

00:14:43.760 --> 00:14:44.440
The spot?

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:50.120
It is a game-changer

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:52.040
For Cao Fan.

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:55.320
And honestly,

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:58.080
I know what my priority is.

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:06.000
I'm so sorry.

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:09.920
I was wrong to keep you

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:13.320
In the dark.

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:15.200
I get it.

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:17.520
You like to

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:19.440
Bottle things up

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:21.800
So you don't burden anyone.

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:23.560
You think

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:25.840
Showing your feelings

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:27.520
Makes you look weak.

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:29.520
But you can

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:31.200
Let

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:32.280
Your guard down

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:33.080
With me.

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:35.440
I don't want any walls

00:15:35.440 --> 00:15:36.320
Between us.

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:39.080
I just want the real you.

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:42.920
I'm just

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:44.320
Used to

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:46.840
Fighting my own battles.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:49.840
And look where that got you.

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:53.360
Cao Fan is

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:55.960
Everything to Cao Ping.

00:15:58.000 --> 00:15:59.160
And to me...

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:01.360
You are my everything.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.120
I wanna hear

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:08.240
Your thoughts

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:12.080
And share

00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:13.520
Your burdens.

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:16.800
I want to be that person

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:20.440
For you.

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:37.160
Alright.

00:16:38.920 --> 00:16:39.600
I got it.

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:44.800
I just poured my heart out,

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:46.760
And that's all I get?

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:48.640
Do you actually get it?

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.240
100%.

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:31.000
Grandma,

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:32.360
Auntie,

00:17:33.200 --> 00:17:34.320
Relax.

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:36.280
The doc said

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:40.040
His injuries are purely cosmetic.

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:42.080
He's fine.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:51.960
Look,

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:54.520
I don't need you to be a hero.

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:56.640
I just need you

00:17:57.160 --> 00:17:58.720
To stay safe

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:01.680
And stop getting hurt.

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:03.320
Deal?

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:07.920
Listen to your mom.

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:09.880
Own up to your mistake.

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:15.160
Mom,

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:17.840
I'm sorry.

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:19.760
I promise,

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:22.360
No more fighting.

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:38.600
Here, put some meat back.

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:44.400
Alright.

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:46.000
Every cloud

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:47.760
Has a

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:48.920
Silver lining.

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:50.120
Wu is

00:18:50.360 --> 00:18:51.400
Cutting ties

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:52.920
With his past,

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:54.880
So he can grind

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:55.880
With Qing Ye

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:57.520
And secure his future.

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:02.520
Got that?

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:07.720
Now dig in!

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:09.320
Yes, eat, everyone.

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:18.600
Mom, this is awesome.

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:01.280
You probably hate my guts.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:05.040
If hate actually worked,

00:20:05.240 --> 00:20:06.560
You wouldn't be locked up again.

00:20:11.240 --> 00:20:11.720
Listen, I...

00:20:11.720 --> 00:20:12.840
I don't hate you.

00:20:13.880 --> 00:20:15.120
I'm just tired of

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.960
Watching you ruin your life.

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:19.160
You have a total victim mentality,

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:21.000
Blaming the world

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:22.240
For your failures.

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:24.440
But you just

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:26.560
Made the exact same mistake

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:27.640
You did

00:20:27.640 --> 00:20:28.720
Two years ago.

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:42.920
I failed you as a brother.

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:47.320
When you yelled

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:48.720
My name that day,

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:51.960
I realized I wasted those two years

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:52.680
Behind bars.

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:56.280
I claimed

00:20:56.280 --> 00:20:57.720
I did all that for you.

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:01.960
But I was

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:05.600
Actually

00:21:05.600 --> 00:21:06.640
Just acting out.

00:21:09.840 --> 00:21:10.360
Ping...

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:12.680
It's not too late to turn it around.

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:14.800
I never blame you

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:16.640
For my struggles

00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:18.640
Or

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:20.880
For serving time.

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:22.920
If anything,

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:24.520
The grind

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:25.400
Motivated me.

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:27.840
I studied like hell

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:29.200
Because it was

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:30.040
My golden ticket.

00:21:30.120 --> 00:21:30.880
So do your time,

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:35.360
And let's hit reset

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:37.240
When you're out.

00:21:37.920 --> 00:21:38.520
Alright?

00:21:41.040 --> 00:21:42.080
Hit reset?

00:21:44.960 --> 00:21:45.920
With my record?

00:21:47.600 --> 00:21:48.760
How?

00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:53.400
Xing Wu isn't

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:54.920
Pressing charges.

00:21:57.680 --> 00:21:58.720
Just promise me

00:21:59.280 --> 00:22:00.560
You'll keep your nose clean.

00:22:34.600 --> 00:22:35.720
Big news!

00:22:35.800 --> 00:22:36.760
Cao Fan is

00:22:36.800 --> 00:22:38.080
Officially part of

00:22:38.080 --> 00:22:39.320
The squad!

00:22:39.640 --> 00:22:40.400
Let's hear it for her!

00:22:43.840 --> 00:22:44.800
Snack break!

00:22:50.640 --> 00:22:51.400
Ma'am,

00:22:52.920 --> 00:22:54.160
Got room for another student?

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:00.360
I guess.

00:23:00.840 --> 00:23:01.720
You can have my spot.

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:07.360
Here is

00:23:07.520 --> 00:23:08.520
Your daily grind.

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:28.360
Stop slacking!

00:23:41.320 --> 00:23:41.760
Here,

00:23:42.000 --> 00:23:43.440
A little treat.

00:23:43.880 --> 00:23:44.520
Grandma,

