00:37:51.520 --> 00:37:52.760
My goodness!

00:37:53.200 --> 00:37:54.280
Grandma, we made bank!

00:37:54.320 --> 00:37:55.920
We're in the money!

00:37:56.000 --> 00:37:58.880
