00:37:59.120 --> 00:37:59.920
Rich!

00:37:59.960 --> 00:38:00.760
Unbelievable...

00:38:01.520 --> 00:38:03.360
Best day ever!

00:38:03.360 --> 00:38:04.560
Oh my gosh!

00:38:15.040 --> 00:38:16.280
You guys, this is huge.

00:38:16.760 --> 00:38:18.080
Now I can

00:38:18.240 --> 00:38:19.000
Finally

00:38:19.120 --> 00:38:21.680
Pay back Shanxi,

00:38:21.680 --> 00:38:22.800
And Yufen,

00:38:22.800 --> 00:38:23.920
And even Mr. Zhao!

00:38:23.920 --> 00:38:25.520
