00:38:26.880 --> 00:38:28.160
Unbelievable!

00:38:28.160 --> 00:38:28.880
Lanfang,

00:38:28.920 --> 00:38:31.240
I'm so proud of you.

00:38:32.160 --> 00:38:33.160
Thanks, Mom.

