Liu Nian,

00:38:36.320 --> 00:38:37.040
Come sit.

00:38:38.200 --> 00:38:38.920
Honestly,

00:38:39.000 --> 00:38:39.600
I

00:38:40.160 --> 00:38:41.320
Wanna thank you guys.

00:38:41.640 --> 00:38:43.040
Ye, Liu Nian,

00:38:43.320 --> 00:38:45.080
And my amazing son.

00:38:45.680 --> 00:38:46.880
Thank you all so, so much.

00:38:47.280 --> 00:38:48.360
You too, Lanfang!

00:38:48.400 --> 00:38:50.080
Alright, save the waterworks!

00:38:50.600 --> 00:38:51.320
Yeah, Auntie.

00:38:51.440 --> 00:38:52.080
You're a

00:38:52.080 --> 00:38:53.240
