00:39:11.640 --> 00:39:12.200
Take it, man.

00:39:12.320 --> 00:39:13.840
Yes, keep it!

00:39:13.960 --> 00:39:14.800
Yeah!

00:39:14.880 --> 00:39:15.400
I won't say no to that!

00:39:15.400 --> 00:39:15.880
Put it away!

00:39:15.880 --> 00:39:16.520
Thanks, Lanfang.

00:39:17.040 --> 00:39:19.320
One last

00:39:19.520 --> 00:39:21.040
Shift tomorrow,

00:39:21.440 --> 00:39:24.120
And then we party!

00:39:24.360 --> 00:39:25.440
Hell yeah!

00:39:25.520 --> 00:39:26.600
Let's make this

00:39:26.600 --> 00:39:27.880
The best

00:39:27.960 --> 00:39:29.120
New Year ever!

00:39:29.200 --> 00:39:31.000
Happy New Year!

00:39:31.120 --> 00:39:33.040
To wealth and health!

