00:40:18.040 --> 00:40:19.360
Just so you know,

00:40:19.960 --> 00:40:21.000
I am

00:40:21.200 --> 00:40:21.960
A self-made

00:40:22.400 --> 00:40:25.160
Business woman!

00:40:26.560 --> 00:40:27.440
Which makes you...

00:40:27.440 --> 00:40:29.240
A wealthy heir!

