Look at my walk!

00:40:33.000 --> 00:40:34.680
Don't pull a muscle with that ego!

00:40:35.200 --> 00:40:37.040
Watch me!

00:40:51.280 --> 00:40:52.160
Candied fruit!

00:40:52.640 --> 00:40:54.160
Sweet and tart!

00:40:55.640 --> 00:40:56.800
Best in town! Eat your heart!

